            <head n="1" source="#source-219125-219227"><seg source="#source-219146-219158">第八講　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-219158-219182"><rb>執著</rb><rt>とらわれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-219182-219197">なきこころ</seg></head>
