            <head n="1" source="#source-293311-293410"><seg source="#source-293332-293353">第十講　般若は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-293353-293374"><rb>仏陀</rb><rt>ほとけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-293374-293380">の母</seg></head>
